透过薄纱窗帘的金色晨光照亮, 从侧面拍摄.\n在紧凑的1:1特写镜头中, 仅可见女性脸庞的一半, 略微转向附近的一扇窗户, 温暖, 清晨的阳光透过白色布帘倾泻而入.光线柔和地掠过她的面容, 突显出她脸颊上细腻的桃色绒毛和嘴唇附近干燥皮肤的微弱纹理.她的眼睛在画框边缘刚刚可见, 捕捉到一丝琥珀色光芒.漂浮在空气中的杂乱发丝在逆光中发光.背景模糊不清但显然是室内--可能是卧室--失焦并染上日黄色调.她表情中的轻微眯眼可见清晨的昏沉感.镜头在她脸部最亮的部分周围形成淡淡的光晕, 光线最强的区域有轻微的色彩溢出.感觉非常亲密, 像是醒来后拍下的第一张照片, 在寂静中捕捉."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 520, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 521, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [437.6938171386719, 146.9487762451172], "pos": [8764.373046875, -784.5177001953125], "id": 265, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.43", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [], "size": [210, 246], "pos": [8412.6611328125, -185.3040313720703], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 522, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 266, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "UPSCALE_MODEL", "links": [527], "label": "UPSCALE_MODEL", "type": "UPSCALE_MODEL", "localized_name": "UPSCALE_MODEL"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [8006.12109375, -390.6838684082031], "widgets_values": ["4x-UltraSharp.pth"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 267, "type": "UpscaleModelLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UpscaleModelLoader"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [210, 88], "pos": [8474.3466796875, 123.05250549316406], "widgets_values": ["1408"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anythi